{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using scgpt encoder with transformer aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5136 and F1 of 0.4982. The results suggest scgpt may underperform compared to scvi_n200 encoders in multiprofile settings, but the relative impact of encoder design versus aggregation methods remains uncertain without direct comparison. The role of other design choices and multimodal interactions is still unexplored."
}

